  "definition": "Cooperate",
  "effectiveDate": "2024-12-01",
  "historyNote": "#12863, eff 9-4-19; ss by #13293, eff 11-24-21; ss by #13797, eff 10-26-23 (formerly Plc 102.04); ss by #14135, eff 12-1-24",
