  "prefLabel": "Plc 102.06 Cooperate",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Plc 102.06 “Cooperate” means to provide the OPLC with any information requested during an inspection or investigation and to answer any questions posed that relate to a licensee’s practices in the profession in order to enable the OPLC to determine compliance with applicable law.\n\nSource. #12863, eff 9-4-19; ss by #13293, eff 11-24-21; ss by #13797, eff 10-26-23 (formerly Plc 102.04); ss by #14135, eff 12-1-24",
